  "abstract": "<jats:p>We demonstrate an O-band silicon Euler microring modulator with a 3 THz FSR and &gt;67 GHz EO bandwidth. The inductive-peaking design achieves a 256 Gb/s PAM4 data rate, confirming its capabilities for next-generation optical interconnects.</jats:p>",
